  m_text: "\u2022 Metallic: 0 for non-metals, 1 for metals.\n\u2022 Values in between are only for mixed surfaces, such as dust on metal.\n\u2022 Smoothness 0 scatters light in all directions (matte). Smoothness 1 gives a sharp, mirror-like reflection.\n\u2022 A metal has no diffuse colour: its base colour tints its reflection.\n\u2022 Front row: metallic 0. Back row: metallic 1."
