  m_text: "\u2022 Lit: physically based. Reacts to lights and reflects its surroundings.\n\u2022 Simple Lit: reacts to lights with a simpler, cheaper model.\n\u2022 Unlit: shows its colour as it is. Lights and shadows have no effect.\n\u2022 A Spot Light shines from the front, a blue Point Light from the left.\n\u2022 Front row: rough. Back row: smooth."
